@RFQAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5013
@token = 

### Register supplier (creates users + suppliers in one transaction)
POST {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "supplier@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "companyName": "Acme Supplies Ltd",
  "registrationNumber": "REG-10001",
  "contactPerson": "Jane Doe",
  "phone": "+15551234567"
}

### Login
POST {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "supplier@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Get logged-in user
GET {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List users – Approver only
GET {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Activate/deactivate user – Approver only
PATCH {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users/1/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Get my supplier profile – Supplier only
GET {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/suppliers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update my supplier profile – Supplier only
PUT {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/suppliers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Acme Supplies International",
  "contactPerson": "Jane Doe",
  "phone": "+15559876543"
}

### List suppliers – ProcurementOfficer or Approver
GET {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/suppliers?page=1&pageSize=20&approvalStatus=Pending&companyName=Acme
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get supplier by ID – ProcurementOfficer or Approver
GET {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/suppliers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Review supplier (approve/suspend) – ProcurementOfficer only
PATCH {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/suppliers/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approvalStatus": "Approved"
}

### Create RFQ (Draft) – ProcurementOfficer only
POST {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rfqs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rfqNumber": "RFQ-2026-001",
  "title": "Industrial Motors Procurement",
  "description": "Annual motors and drives requirement",
  "currencyCode": "USD",
  "items": [
    {
      "itemName": "3-Phase Induction Motor 5HP",
      "description": "IE3 efficiency",
      "quantity": 25,
      "unit": "EA"
    },
    {
      "itemName": "Variable Frequency Drive",
      "description": "5HP matched",
      "quantity": 25,
      "unit": "EA"
    },
    {
      "itemName": "Mounting Kit",
      "quantity": 25,
      "unit": "SET"
    }
  ]
}

### Update draft RFQ – ProcurementOfficer (creator only)
PUT {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rfqs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Industrial Motors Procurement – Rev A",
  "description": "Updated quantities for plant expansion",
  "currencyCode": "USD",
  "items": [
    {
      "itemName": "3-Phase Induction Motor 5HP",
      "description": "IE3 efficiency",
      "quantity": 30,
      "unit": "EA"
    },
    {
      "itemName": "Variable Frequency Drive",
      "quantity": 30,
      "unit": "EA"
    }
  ]
}

### Get RFQ by ID – ProcurementOfficer or Approver
GET {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rfqs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List RFQs – ProcurementOfficer or Approver
GET {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rfqs?page=1&pageSize=20&status=Draft&rfqNumber=RFQ-2026&title=Motors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create round 1 (RFQ must be Draft) – ProcurementOfficer
POST {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rfqs/1/rounds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deadline": "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"
}

### Publish round – ProcurementOfficer
PATCH {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rfqs/1/rounds/1/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Close round – ProcurementOfficer
PATCH {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rfqs/1/rounds/1/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List rounds – ProcurementOfficer or Approver
GET {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rfqs/1/rounds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get round by ID – ProcurementOfficer or Approver
GET {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rfqs/1/rounds/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create subsequent round (RFQ + latest round must be Evaluated) – ProcurementOfficer
# After Module 6 sets Evaluated, example:
POST {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rfqs/1/rounds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deadline": "2027-03-31T18:00:00Z"
}

### Submit bid (approved supplier, published round, before deadline)
POST {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rfqs/1/rounds/1/bids
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "rfqItemId": 1, "unitPrice": 1250.50 },
    { "rfqItemId": 2, "unitPrice": 850.00 },
    { "rfqItemId": 3, "unitPrice": 45.25 }
  ]
}

### Withdraw bid
PATCH {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/bids/1/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My bids (paginated)
GET {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/bids/me?page=1&pageSize=20&rfqId=1&status=Submitted
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My bid details
GET {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/bids/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Evaluate round (RFQ + round Closed, submitted bids) – ProcurementOfficer
POST {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rfqs/1/rounds/1/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get evaluation results – ProcurementOfficer or Approver
GET {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rfqs/1/rounds/1/evaluation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get evaluation detail for a bid – ProcurementOfficer or Approver
GET {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rfqs/1/rounds/1/evaluation/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approve evaluation (unique lowest rank) – Approver only
POST {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rfqs/1/rounds/1/evaluation/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "Approved",
  "reason": null
}

### Reject tied evaluation – Approver only
POST {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rfqs/1/rounds/1/evaluation/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "Rejected",
  "reason": "Multiple suppliers share the lowest bid price. A new bidding round is required."
}

### Get evaluation decision (or Pending) – ProcurementOfficer or Approver
GET {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rfqs/1/rounds/1/evaluation/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create award (after EvaluationApproved) – Approver only
POST {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rfqs/1/rounds/1/award
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bidId": 1,
  "awardComment": "Approved based on the completed evaluation and lowest evaluated bid."
}

### Get award by RFQ – ProcurementOfficer or Approver
GET {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rfqs/1/award
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List awards – ProcurementOfficer or Approver
GET {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/awards?page=1&pageSize=20&rfqNumber=RFQ-2026&companyName=Acme
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Audit logs (paginated + filters) – ProcurementOfficer or Approver
GET {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/audit-logs?page=1&pageSize=10&action=RfqAwarded&entityType=Rfq&entityId=1&userId=2&fromDate=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&toDate=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Audit log by ID
GET {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/audit-logs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Audit history for entity
GET {{RFQAPI_HostAddress}}/api/audit-logs/entity/RfqRound/1?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}